        <activityName xml:lang="en">Metal coating plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Metal coating plant
Inventory of plant for making selective coatings on metal sheets. Production capacity 100000 m2 of coatings per year. Life time 30a.;
UUID: 8e53ab63-da9f-354d-9543-6c64ed7b6895
Basic assumption for land use and buildings, no machinery data. 
Location: Production plants in DE, DK, US and CH.
Technology: Sputtering, black majic and black chrome coating.
Time period: Environmental report.
Production volume: About 700000 m2 in 2000.
Sampling: Environmental report and personal communication. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8e53ab63-da9f-354d-9543-6c64ed7b6895.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
